    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Broad term used to define a physical System, typically a substance or mixture of substances, in different states of matter or phases, of which something is composed or can be made. According to this definition, a Sample is constituted by at least one Material. Material(s) may undergo some kind of Processing and Treatment and/or Measurement."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
